    "heading": "Line [Area of Effect]",
    "lineStart": 13405,
    "lineEnd": 13409
  },
  "section": "8.98",
  "rulesText": "A Line is an area of effect that extends from a point of origin in a straight path along its length and covers an area defined by its width. The effect that creates a Line specifies its length and width.\n\nA Line's point of origin isn't included in the area of effect unless its creator decides otherwise."
}
